# Document decisions

When making a non-obvious choice (architecture, UX priority, load path, convention, “don’t do X”), record **why** in the same change set as the code.

1. Prefer a short **inline code comment** next to the constraint.
2. Otherwise add/update an entry in [`docs/DECISIONS.md`](docs/DECISIONS.md).

Keep rule files short — link here instead of restating full rationale. If you change behavior that contradicts a recorded decision, update or supersede that entry before committing.
